        "timestamp": 1774348191
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"417769\">Bulhwi Cha</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/116395-maths/topic/accessibility.20and.20descending.20chains/near/581319468\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I also wonder whether there are any textbooks that cover the accessibility predicate in detail.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I haven't seen one that mentions a lemma like <code>Acc.descending_chain_ends_at_min_of_acc</code>.</p>",
